{"5012180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stellar Courier", "steam_appid": 5012180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b0dba6f8e57fb1930787d8a2f2b4fc12.poster.avif?t=1787857636\" width=256 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b0dba6f8e57fb1930787d8a2f2b4fc12.webm?t=1787857636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One package. One route. A whole galaxy in the way.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Star Empire fell a hundred years ago. Pirates control the trade routes, and the old army still thinks it is in charge. Your boss at First Parsec, a delivery company, gives you a simple job: take a package to station Sigma, on the other side of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Courier is an arcade space combat game, like X-Wing and Freespace. Simple controls, fast fights, a story that moves forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane-like flight — throttle, yaw, pitch, roll. Dogfights feel like air combat in space. No joystick needed, no manual to read.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons, missiles and beams against fighters, bombers and capital ships. Shields, target lock, quick restarts. Enemies work together — fly badly and you will pay for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign with more than twenty missions in three acts: pirates, the old army, and the aliens. Between missions, pick your ship and add mods. New ships and mods unlock as you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game mod manager with Steam Workshop support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b718c96e43b2c13cdf7cf09f3f230db9.webp?t=1787857636\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b718c96e43b2c13cdf7cf09f3f230db9.poster.avif?t=1787857636\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=120 /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b0dba6f8e57fb1930787d8a2f2b4fc12.poster.avif?t=1787857636\" width=256 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b0dba6f8e57fb1930787d8a2f2b4fc12.webm?t=1787857636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One package. One route. A whole galaxy in the way.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Star Empire fell a hundred years ago. Pirates control the trade routes, and the old army still thinks it is in charge. Your boss at First Parsec, a delivery company, gives you a simple job: take a package to station Sigma, on the other side of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Courier is an arcade space combat game, like X-Wing and Freespace. Simple controls, fast fights, a story that moves forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane-like flight — throttle, yaw, pitch, roll. Dogfights feel like air combat in space. No joystick needed, no manual to read.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons, missiles and beams against fighters, bombers and capital ships. Shields, target lock, quick restarts. Enemies work together — fly badly and you will pay for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story campaign with more than twenty missions in three acts: pirates, the old army, and the aliens. Between missions, pick your ship and add mods. New ships and mods unlock as you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game mod manager with Steam Workshop support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b718c96e43b2c13cdf7cf09f3f230db9.webp?t=1787857636\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/extras/b718c96e43b2c13cdf7cf09f3f230db9.poster.avif?t=1787857636\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=120 /></picture></span></p>", "short_description": "Arcade space shooter. You are a courier with one package to deliver across a broken galaxy. Plane-like flight, fights with pirates, the old army and aliens in a 20+ mission story campaign. Pick your ship and mods between missions. No grind, no filler.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/babd115cdbea5eaa5f06e4f6977924fae76fa6f9/header.jpg?t=1787857636", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/bcb02678bcc6e45f80b0ef3e6e2a1bc33bb15ecf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787857636", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5012180/bcb02678bcc6e45f80b0ef3e6e2a1bc33bb15ecf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787857636", "website": "https://stellarcourier.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong>